       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADDTAX.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 AMOUNT   PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 RATE     PIC 9V99.
       01 TOTAL    PIC 9(6)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY VALUE AMOUNT RATE
                          RETURNING TOTAL.
           COMPUTE TOTAL = AMOUNT + AMOUNT * RATE
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM ADDTAX.
